    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is peeled off, rind,
				husk</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				674
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				266.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς . . σαρκοειδοῦς φύσεως λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					76a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύων λέμματα</span>
			<i>scales</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>a mere husk</i>, of one who has been swindled, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxil.
				33.5
			</span></i>.</div>
